{
  "name": "proof-systems",
  "description": "A comprehensive suite of zero-knowledge proof primitives and systems centered around the Kimchi implementation of the PLONK protocol. It provides highly optimized components for elliptic curve arithmetic on Pasta curves, polynomial commitment schemes, and specialized circuit gates for cryptographic primitives like Keccak and Poseidon. The repository enables recursive proof composition and incrementally verifiable computation (IVC) through the Pickles accumulation scheme and folding-based architectures.",
